# Scriptorium environment — copy to .env if you ever need one. Most days you don't.
#
# Ports (documented in RUNBOOK.md; both are Scriptorium's claims):
#   frontend  5180  (vite, strictPort)
#   backend   8012  (uvicorn)
#
# PYTHONUTF8=1 is set inside every .cmd wrapper. If you run the service by hand,
# set it yourself first — Greek/Hebrew text WILL corrupt without it.
#
# ############################################################################
# #  LEAVE ANTHROPIC_API_KEY UNSET — DO NOT ADD IT HERE, EVER.               #
# #  If ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is present in the environment, claude-agent-sdk    #
# #  silently bills pay-per-token API credits instead of the Max plan's      #
# #  Agent SDK credit. Subscription auth comes from being logged in via      #
# #  `claude` on this machine. No key. Not even commented out with a real    #
# #  value. (Divergence Rule 5.)                                             #
# ############################################################################
